  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 29-layer planar multilayer thin-film stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2 (29 film layers). Optimize all 29 layer thicknesses simultaneously. Initial thicknesses: quarter-wave at 265 nm center wavelength using measured n values from hfo2 and MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) datasets. Thickness bounds: ±2.0 nm relaxation from initial quarter-wave values for edge layers (layers 1, 2, 28, 29), ±1.5 nm for interior layers. Curvature regularization weight: 0.08. Reinitialize thickness parameters with uniform perturbation range ±5 nm to break alternating patterns. Spectral targets: maximize transmittance 255-280 nm, minimize transmittance 300-700 nm, minimize transmittance 700-1100 nm. No metal layers. Use gradient_thickness optimizer. Total layers fixed at 29.",
